{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "El Gateway: consumo de sus réplicas de Envoy para dimensionarlas, sus rutas y lo que lo gestiona. Se llega con doble clic en el Gateway del mapa. Para decidir, mira al menos 7 días.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Mapa de servicio",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "apps",
      "tooltip": "Volver al mapa",
      "url": "/d/servicemap?var-cluster=${cluster}",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "asDropdown": false,
      "tags": []
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Certificado caduca en",
      "description": "Días hasta que caduca el certificado del Gateway que antes caduca. Ámbar por debajo de 30, rojo por debajo de 15. cert-manager lo renueva solo antes de que llegue; si baja de 30, no lo está consiguiendo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "min(dependencia_certificado_caduca_segundos{cluster=\"$cluster\", gateway=\"$gateway\"} / 86400)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 15
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 30
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Renovación",
      "description": "Si cert-manager tiene el certificado listo. «No se pudo renovar» con la caducidad todavía lejos es un fallo de renovación: se ve antes de que caduque.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "min(dependencia_certificado_listo{cluster=\"$cluster\", gateway=\"$gateway\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "No se pudo renovar",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Listo",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Certificados",
      "description": "Cada certificado del Gateway con sus dominios, los días que le quedan y si está listo. Del mapper.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "dependencia_certificado_caduca_segundos{cluster=\"$cluster\", gateway=\"$gateway\"} / 86400",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "dependencia_certificado_listo{cluster=\"$cluster\", gateway=\"$gateway\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Certificado"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 150
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Dominios"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.inspect",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Días"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "yellow",
                      "value": 15
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": 30
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Estado"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "No se pudo renovar",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "Listo",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 160
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "includeByName": {
              "certificado": true,
              "dominios": true,
              "Value #A": true,
              "Value #B": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "certificado": 0,
              "dominios": 1,
              "Value #A": 2,
              "Value #B": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "certificado": "Certificado",
              "dominios": "Dominios",
              "Value #A": "Días",
              "Value #B": "Estado"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Réplicas",
      "description": "Réplicas de Envoy con métricas ahora mismo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=\"$cluster\", pod=~\"envoy-$gw_ns-$gateway-[a-z0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]{5,10}-[a-z0-9]{5}\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CPU media",
      "description": "Núcleos de la réplica que más usa, media del rango.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 3,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "avg_over_time((max(sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cluster=\"$cluster\", pod=~\"envoy-$gw_ns-$gateway-[a-z0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]{5,10}-[a-z0-9]{5}\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))))[$__range:5m])",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CPU p95",
      "description": "Núcleos. El 95 % del tiempo la réplica que más usa está en esto o menos: la referencia para la request.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, (max(sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cluster=\"$cluster\", pod=~\"envoy-$gw_ns-$gateway-[a-z0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]{5,10}-[a-z0-9]{5}\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))))[$__range:5m])",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CPU máxima",
      "description": "Núcleos, el pico más alto del rango (ventanas de 5 minutos).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max_over_time((max(sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cluster=\"$cluster\", pod=~\"envoy-$gw_ns-$gateway-[a-z0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]{5,10}-[a-z0-9]{5}\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))))[$__range:5m])",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RAM media",
      "description": "Working set de la réplica que más usa, media del rango.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "avg_over_time((max(sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=\"$cluster\", pod=~\"envoy-$gw_ns-$gateway-[a-z0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]{5,10}-[a-z0-9]{5}\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})))[$__range:5m])",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RAM p95",
      "description": "Working set. Referencia para la request de memoria.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, (max(sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=\"$cluster\", pod=~\"envoy-$gw_ns-$gateway-[a-z0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]{5,10}-[a-z0-9]{5}\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})))[$__range:5m])",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RAM máxima",
      "description": "Working set, el pico más alto del rango. Manda para el límite: si Envoy lo pasa, muere por OOM y se cae la entrada.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max_over_time((max(sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=\"$cluster\", pod=~\"envoy-$gw_ns-$gateway-[a-z0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]{5,10}-[a-z0-9]{5}\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})))[$__range:5m])",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU por réplica",
      "description": "Núcleos de cada réplica de Envoy. Si una va muy por encima de la otra, el reparto no está equilibrado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cluster=\"$cluster\", pod=~\"envoy-$gw_ns-$gateway-[a-z0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]{5,10}-[a-z0-9]{5}\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RAM por réplica",
      "description": "Working set de cada réplica de Envoy.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=\"$cluster\", pod=~\"envoy-$gw_ns-$gateway-[a-z0-9]{8}-[a-z0-9]{5,10}-[a-z0-9]{5}\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Rutas",
      "description": "Lo que enruta el Gateway: cada dominio, a qué servicio va y si ese servicio responde. Del mapper.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "dependencia{cluster=\"$cluster\", src=\"$gateway\", relacion=\"enruta\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Sonda"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "no responde",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "responde",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "2": {
                        "text": "sin sondear",
                        "color": "blue",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "includeByName": {
              "hosts": true,
              "dst": true,
              "dst_ns": true,
              "dst_port": true,
              "clave": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "hosts": 0,
              "dst": 1,
              "dst_ns": 2,
              "dst_port": 3,
              "clave": 4,
              "Value": 5
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "hosts": "Dominios",
              "dst": "Servicio",
              "dst_ns": "Namespace",
